      "description": "Preview views float above the stage; they do not consume its height.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-dock\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Playground views\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-selected\">Preview</button><button type=\"button\">Usage</button><button type=\"button\">Source</button><a href=\"/components/flowing-water#component-api\" class=\"ds-docs\" aria-label=\"Read component documentation\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 4c-3-2-6-2-8-1v13c2-1 5-1 8 1 3-2 6-2 8-1V3c-2-1-5-1-8 1Zm0 0v13\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-dock{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:6px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink,#171717) 18%,transparent);border-radius:999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface,#fff) 72%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(1.4)}.ds-dock button{min-height:42px;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#666);font:500 12px/1.5 var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-dock .ds-selected{background:var(--ink,#171717);color:var(--surface,#fff)}.ds-dock button:not(.ds-selected):hover,.ds-dock .ds-docs:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink,#171717) 8%,transparent);color:var(--ink,#171717)}.ds-dock .ds-docs{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;margin-left:2px;color:var(--muted,#666);border-radius:50%;text-decoration:none}.ds-docs svg{width:17px;height:17px}.ds-dock button:focus-visible,.ds-dock a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a64500);outline-offset:3px}"
